    <string name="shortcuts_shape">Shape</string>
    <string name="shortcuts_shape_help_title">About icon shapes</string>
    <string name="shortcuts_shape_help">\"Launcher shape\" fills the whole icon, so your launcher\'s own shape (circle, squircle…) is used. Other shapes are drawn inside it on a transparent background; launchers with a smaller mask may still trim the corners. Some launchers redraw or resize shortcut icons.</string>
